  "definition": "Scoliosis, in this packet’s context of adolescent idiopathic scoliosis, is a musculoskeletal condition in adolescents involving a deformity of the spine. The packet also indicates that beyond the physical problem, it can be linked with psychosocial and mental health effects.",
